    "detailed_description": "Synopsis<br />\r\nLos Infernales is a platform game, with runner elements, about the story of the \u201cinfernales\u201d, a militia of brave warriors, who repelled the royalist invasions in northern Argentina during the independence period.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe key features are:<br />\r\nA) Original mechanics: It\u2019s like a platform game with runner elements.<br />\r\nB) Simple mechanics and controls but with very versatile gameplay. You're going to have fun quickly.<br />\r\nC) You are a militia, so you\u2019ll fight until the last infernal falls. You must to care your team because  each of the living militia warriors are your lifes<br />\r\nD) It\u2019s based on a true story and the mystique of the infernals, a militia that faced the veterans of the Napoleonic wars.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game will have:<br />\r\n\u2022Single player and local multiplayer modes<br />\r\n\u20226 types of heroes with different weapons/abilities<br />\r\n\u2022Heach level will represent a real battle<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe pixel art style is inspired in fine art history",
